# Customer conversation content MUST NOT be committed.
# Exclude contents, not the directories themselves, so git can still reach the
# .gitkeep files below (it will not descend into a fully-ignored directory).
data/*
!data/inbox/
data/inbox/*
!data/inbox/zalo/
data/inbox/zalo/*
!data/inbox/zalo/.gitkeep
!data/out/
data/out/*
!data/out/.gitkeep
probe.md

